{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Clementine \u201c<strong>Cleo</strong>\u201d Ace, an eager to learn <strong>apprentice</strong> to the world renowned detective, <strong>Maya</strong> Lynch, who also just happens to be your favorite aunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/cbdf05a4b85303d31d1c8586f5c4b3c7.avif?t=1772976187\" width=1232 height=420 /></span>Whether you\u2019re untangling a complex murder or solving an impossible heist, there\u2019s never a dull moment when you two are on the case. Every mystery comes with its unique challenges, and to solve them, you must:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.<strong> Search for clues and spot discrepancies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/cc5db09e90639dcde84eb504f461dc80.poster.avif?t=1772976187\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/cc5db09e90639dcde84eb504f461dc80.webm?t=1772976187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.<strong> Ask the right questions, </strong>whether you\u2019re interviewing witnesses, testing for a  poison or searching through traffic records<strong>.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/dc5df730ab6b6768f9095e8467a0e1a0.poster.avif?t=1772976187\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/dc5df730ab6b6768f9095e8467a0e1a0.webm?t=1772976187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.<strong> </strong>The art of <strong>deduction</strong> is a must for any budding detective.<strong> Piece together clues </strong>using logic and observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/a7453bd6ed8977f9636a98505d54a6df.poster.avif?t=1772976187\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/a7453bd6ed8977f9636a98505d54a6df.webm?t=1772976187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.<strong> Figure out who did it.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/157568e478e91d8af6add95b153d223e.poster.avif?t=1772976187\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/157568e478e91d8af6add95b153d223e.webm?t=1772976187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>5.<strong> Reconstruct the crime.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/4af11ac15427e823e3a0ba0bd7086481.poster.avif?t=1772976187\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/4af11ac15427e823e3a0ba0bd7086481.webm?t=1772976187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618570?t=1772976187","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/d7ca6d23e06fc966bd729a24966c2ff52a9e07e2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772976187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/2c738dd785ea70f57b35d496b4569a9d089036fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772976187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/2c738dd785ea70f57b35d496b4569a9d089036fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772976187","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4159750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Clementine \u201c<strong>Cleo</strong>\u201d Ace, an eager to learn <strong>apprentice</strong> to the world renowned detective, <strong>Maya</strong> Lynch, who also just happens to be your favorite aunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/cbdf05a4b85303d31d1c8586f5c4b3c7.avif?t=1772976187\" width=1232 height=420 /></span>Whether you\u2019re untangling a complex murder or solving an impossible heist, there\u2019s never a dull moment when you two are on the case. Every mystery comes with its unique challenges, and to solve them, you must:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.<strong> Search for clues and spot discrepancies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/cc5db09e90639dcde84eb504f461dc80.poster.avif?t=1772976187\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/cc5db09e90639dcde84eb504f461dc80.webm?t=1772976187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.<strong> Ask the right questions, </strong>whether you\u2019re interviewing witnesses, testing for a  poison or searching through traffic records<strong>.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/dc5df730ab6b6768f9095e8467a0e1a0.poster.avif?t=1772976187\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/dc5df730ab6b6768f9095e8467a0e1a0.webm?t=1772976187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.<strong> </strong>The art of <strong>deduction</strong> is a must for any budding detective.<strong> Piece together clues </strong>using logic and observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/a7453bd6ed8977f9636a98505d54a6df.poster.avif?t=1772976187\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/a7453bd6ed8977f9636a98505d54a6df.webm?t=1772976187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.<strong> Figure out who did it.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/157568e478e91d8af6add95b153d223e.poster.avif?t=1772976187\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/157568e478e91d8af6add95b153d223e.webm?t=1772976187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>5.<strong> Reconstruct the crime.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/4af11ac15427e823e3a0ba0bd7086481.poster.avif?t=1772976187\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/extras/4af11ac15427e823e3a0ba0bd7086481.webm?t=1772976187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["darqwerful"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618570/d510bc199f3f22794ec780675f41bd21206f50e1/header.jpg?t=1772976187","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3618570/2106897107/6ffa3bd7d16d3ec1e89a7086914f809a7c39e01a/1755082361/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755758334","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3618570/2106897107/6ffa3bd7d16d3ec1e89a7086914f809a7c39e01a/1755082361/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755758334","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3618570/2106897107/6ffa3bd7d16d3ec1e89a7086914f809a7c39e01a/1755082361/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755758334","id":257175005,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175005/5a7b0f996dd20ac9a593012c835a0f930949b0c6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755758334"}],"name":"The Detective's Apprentice","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["darqwerful"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Atos criminosos","rating":"10","rating_